Private access is ON.

While this file exists, server.mjs shows gate.html to every visitor and serves
no real page, image or document until the correct access phrase is entered.
The phrase is "sargara2026" unless ACCESS_PASSWORD is set on the hosting
platform. Visitors stay unlocked for 30 days (ACCESS_DAYS) in a signed cookie.

Open the site again by deleting this file and redeploying:

    rm access.on

Emergency bypass without a code change: set PUBLIC=true in the platform
environment. Sign out on a device by visiting /?signout=1
